          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Connect with {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — aromatherapy crafted for calm, clarity, and ritual.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#0f1720; --card:#0b1320; --muted:#9aa5b1; --accent:#9ad3c6; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\\n      --maxw:1100px; --radius:14px;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;color: #e6eef3;background: radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 10% 10%, rgba(154,211,198,0.06), transparent 8%), radial-gradient(1000px 500px at 90% 90%, rgba(150,180,220,0.03), transparent 10%), var(--bg);}\\n    a{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:36px auto;padding:28px;position:relative}\\n\\n    /* Top nav */\\n    .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}\\n    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1b2b3a 0%, #0b2230 100%);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(2,6,23,0.6), inset 0 -6px 24px rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}\\n    .logo svg{width:36px;height:36px}\\n    nav ul{display:flex;gap:14px;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    nav a{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px}\\n    nav a:hover{background:var(--glass)}\\n\\n    /* Hero */\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:stretch;margin-top:22px}\\n    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:26px;color:#eaf3f6;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(2,10,20,0.6);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:28px;line-height:1.05}\\n    .tag{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:18px}\\n    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .btn{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#7fd3c0);border:none;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;color:#05323a;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}\\n    .btn.secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    /* SVG background panel */\\n    .pattern-wrap{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:12px}\\n    .pattern-wrap svg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;opacity:0.16}\\n\\n    /* Ritual card */\\n    .ritual{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .ritual p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .pill{display:inline-block;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}\\n\\n    /* Grid sections */\\n    .grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:20px}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    /* Schedule */\\n    .schedule .slot{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.01), transparent);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}\\n\\n    /* Pricing */\\n    .pricing-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}\\n    .price{padding:16px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.18), rgba(255,255,255,0.02));border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .price h3{margin:0 0 8px 0}\\n\\n    /* FAQ */\\n    .faq{margin-top:18px}\\n    details{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}\\n    summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}\\n    .foot{margin-top:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n\\n    /* CTA form */\\n    form{display:grid;gap:10px}\\n    input,textarea,select{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;color:#eaf3f6}\\n    textarea{min-height:110px}\\n\\n    footer{margin-top:30px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:900px){\\n      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n      .grid3{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      .pricing-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header class=\\\"nav\\\" role=\\\"banner\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n          <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 48 48\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n            <defs>\\n              <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#9ad3c6\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#6bd1c0\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n            </defs>\\n            <rect x=\\\"4\\\" y=\\\"6\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"36\\\" rx=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" />\\n            <path d=\\\"M16 28c4-6 12-6 14-12\\\" stroke=\\\"#042e2a\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2.4\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\"/>\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"blends.html\\\">Blends</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"shop.html\\\">Boutique</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Investment</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Story</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Reach</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <!-- Hero -->\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h1>Connect with scent-led care</h1>\\n        <div class=\\\"tag\\\">A practical aromatherapy approach for grounded rituals and daily balance — delivered in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.</div>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">I blend clinical caution with cozy ritual: plant-powered aroma, transparent sourcing, and clear safety guidance. Choose a consult, a VIP Day, or seasonal blends.</p>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\" class=\\\"cta-row\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn secondary\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Schedule a chat</a>\\n          <span style=\\\"margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">or call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></span>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\\\" class=\\\"ritual\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"pill\\\">VIP Day model</span>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Transformative half-day where we co-create blends, ritual guides, and a practical toolkit you can use for months.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"pattern-wrap card\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n        <!-- Unique SVG pattern: organic grid + halftone blobs -->\\n        <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 800 600\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n          <defs>\\n            <linearGradient id=\\\"sg\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#8fd6c8\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.12\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#7ac7b6\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.08\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n            <pattern id=\\\"dots\\\" x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"40\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\">\\n              <circle cx=\\\"6\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"1.8\\\" fill=\\\"#c8efe6\\\" opacity=\\\"0.12\\\" />\\n            </pattern>\\n            <filter id=\\\"s\\\"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\\\"30\\\"/></filter>\\n          </defs>\\n          <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#sg)\\\" />\\n          <g filter=\\\"url(#s)\\\" fill=\\\"#8fd6c8\\\" opacity=\\\"0.26\\\">\\n            <circle cx=\\\"160\\\" cy=\\\"120\\\" r=\\\"120\\\" />\\n            <circle cx=\\\"560\\\" cy=\\\"420\\\" r=\\\"110\\\" />\\n          </g>\\n          <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#dots)\\\" />\\n          <g transform=\\\"translate(24,40)\\\">\\n            <path d=\\\"M28 180c40-52 120-68 180-28s92 112 44 156-132 20-188-36S-12 242 28 180z\\\" fill=\\\"#042e2a\\\" opacity=\\\"0.06\\\" />\\n          </g>\\n          <g transform=\\\"translate(0,0)\\\" fill=\\\"#eaf6f0\\\" opacity=\\\"0.06\\\">\\n            <rect x=\\\"420\\\" y=\\\"90\\\" width=\\\"220\\\" height=\\\"140\\\" rx=\\\"20\\\" />\\n          </g>\\n        </svg>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"position:relative;z-index:1;padding:18px\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Visit & Connect</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Drop a line or bring a scent sample — consultations are by appointment in {{CITY}}.</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Email: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a><br/>Phone: <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- What to expect -->\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">What to expect in a session</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid3\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h4>Listen & map</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">We start with a short intake to understand your routines, sensitivities, and goals. No medical promises — just careful, sensory-based planning.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <h4>Blend & test</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">I create small trial blends you can smell and test. We discuss dilution and patch testing so you feel confident using them safely.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <h4>Ritual & plan</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">A simple, repeatable ritual and practical notes for daily use — plus storage and pet/family safety tips.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Schedule -->\\n    <section class=\\\"card schedule\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Available times & booking</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Choose a short consult or reserve a VIP Day for a deeper co-creation session. Appointments are limited each week to ensure care and time for blending.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:14px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"slot\\\">\\n          <strong>15–30 min consult</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Quick intake + scent exploration • remote or in-person</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\"><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book consult</a></div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"slot\\\">\\n          <strong>VIP Day</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Half-day intensive: blends, ritual templates, and a take-home kit.</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\"><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Reserve VIP Day</a></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Pricing (overview) -->\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Investment</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"pricing-grid\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\">\\n          <h3>Intro Consult</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">30-min scent mapping + recommendations</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px;font-weight:700\\\">$85</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\">\\n          <h3>Custom Blend Session</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">One personalized blend + dilution & ritual guide</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px;font-weight:700\\\">$160</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\">\\n          <h3>VIP Day</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Half-day, up to two blends, take-home kit, and ritual templates</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px;font-weight:700\\\">$720</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"foot\\\">All pricing is illustrative. Final pricing provided at booking. Refunds and cancellations: see policies at booking.</div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- FAQ -->\\n    <section class=\\\"card faq\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">FAQ — safety first</h2>\\n      <details>\\n        <summary>Dilution and topical safety</summary>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Essential oils are potent. I recommend safe dilution ratios for adults and detailed guidance for children/older adults. Never apply undiluted essential oils to skin. Instructions are provided for each blend.</div>\\n      </details>\\n\\n      <details>\\n        <summary>Patch testing</summary>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Always patch-test a new blend on forearm skin for 24 hours before regular use. If redness, itching, or irritation occurs, discontinue and consult a licensed medical professional.</div>\\n      </details>\\n\\n      <details>\\n        <summary>Pets & household members</summary>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Some essential oils can be unsafe for pets. I will provide pet-friendly alternatives and clear usage notes to avoid harm. Please inform me of any pets during consultation.</div>\\n      </details>\\n\\n      <details>\\n        <summary>Pregnancy & medical cautions</summary>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">I avoid recommending certain oils during pregnancy and for specific medical conditions. Aromatherapy is not a substitute for medical care. Always consult your healthcare provider about oil use if pregnant or managing a health condition.</div>\\n      </details>\\n\\n      <details>\\n        <summary>Allergens & sourcing</summary>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">I source from transparent suppliers and can list botanical names and origins. If you have known sensitivities or allergies, please share them before your session.</div>\\n      </details>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- CTA / Contact Form -->\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Get in touch</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Use this form for questions, booking inquiries, or to request a custom blend sample. I reply within 2–3 business days.</p>\\n\\n      <form action=\\\"#\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" onsubmit=\\\"alert('This is a demo form — replace with your booking endpoint.');return false;\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"muted\\\">Name<input name=\\\"name\\\" required placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" /></label>\\n        <label class=\\\"muted\\\">Email<input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" required placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" /></label>\\n        <label class=\\\"muted\\\">Phone<input name=\\\"phone\\\" placeholder=\\\"Optional\\\" /></label>\\n        <label class=\\\"muted\\\">Message<textarea name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell me a little about what drew you here...\\\"></textarea></label>\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send message</button>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn secondary\\\" href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">Email directly</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </form>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\" class=\\\"muted\\\">Prefer to call? <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a>. Visit: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Practitioner: {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}.</div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Aromatherapy that centers safety and ritual.</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Made with care • Favorite blend: {{FAVORITE_BLEND}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# aromatherapy-2026-02-16T17-14-15-913Z-028 — contact page bundle\\n\\nThis chunk includes two files for the site layoutFamily \\\"clinic_modern\\\" and voiceFamily \\\"practical_guide\\\":\\n\\n- contact.html — the contact & FAQ page, containing the required sections: hero, ritual, what_to_expect, schedule, pricing, faq, cta.\\n- README.md — this file.\\n\\nNotes for developers:\\n- Placeholders to replace in contact.html: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{FAVORITE_BLEND}}.\\n- The page is self-contained (no external fonts or CDN). Visual textures come from an inline SVG and CSS gradients.\\n- The contact form is a demo (onsubmit shows an alert). Replace the form action/handler with your booking endpoint or mailing integration.\\n- Safety-first content is included in the FAQ (dilution, patch testing, pets, pregnancy). No medical claims are made.\\n\\nHow to preview:\\n1. Drop this file (contact.html) into your site folder alongside the other site pages (index.html, services.html, etc.).\\n2. Open contact.html in a browser to preview.\\n\\nAccessibility & behavior:\\n- Links use standard anchors to other site pages (index.html, services.html, blends.html, shop.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html).\\n- The layout is responsive and will stack on smaller viewports.\\n\\nDesign choices:\\n- Navigation labels vary subtly from other pages (e.g., \\\"Offerings\\\", \\\"Boutique\\\", \\\"Investment\\\", \\\"Reach\\\").\\n- A unique inline SVG pattern is used as the visual background for the hero sidebar to ensure visual distinctiveness.\\n\\nIf you need additional pages or the SVG exported as a separate asset, request the next chunk and include instructions to generate assets/img/pattern.svg separately.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
